<title>USA: Enterprise Rent-A-Car sells $400 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Rent-A-Car sells $400 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Enterprise Rent-A-Car was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER ENTERPRISE RENT-A-CAR</p>
<p>AMT $400 MLN	 COUPON 6.95 PCT   MATURITY 3/1/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.47   FIRST PAY DATE 9/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.047 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 64 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
